WEBVTT

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:07.050
I wonder what it will be?  
This week, it's this!

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:11.550
You can Special Summon this when 
you’re attacked directly!

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:15.010
When you use this effect, 
the Battle Phase ends.

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:20.010
I attack you directly!

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:26.400
Incredible!  That’s your 
third victory in a row!

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:28.790
Take a cool photo!

00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:29.960
Leave it to me!

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:31.880
Hey, I challenge you again!

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:39.530
Carly, are you planning to be 
a journalist in the future?

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:41.820
I don’t know.

00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:45.700
I just like watching people who try hard.

00:00:46.010 --> 00:00:47.110
You’re weird.

00:00:47.110 --> 00:00:50.510
Even if someone tries hard, 
that can’t make you happy.

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:52.340
That’s not true.

00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:58.290
When I root for someone who tries hard, 
I feel that I can try harder too.

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:01.530
That makes me happy.

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:20.640
Looking over a vast distance

00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:25.740
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:01:26.010 --> 00:01:30.650
Even if it's easier to throw myself away

00:01:31.010 --> 00:01:35.420
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:40.780
No matter how bad today is

00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:45.760
There's still the faintest light

00:01:47.530 --> 00:01:51.170
All I have to do tomorrow

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:55.230
Is light it myself

00:01:55.540 --> 00:02:00.240
I test myself so I won't stop or vanish

00:02:00.610 --> 00:02:05.210
Even if I get countless scars

00:02:05.710 --> 00:02:11.510
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:02:11.820 --> 00:02:15.490
Today will never exist again

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:21.390
So I won't stop or vanish

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:50.430
Superior Light
Majestic Red Dragon

00:02:58.420 --> 00:02:59.820
Look at this, Carly!

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:02.090
Remember!

00:03:03.360 --> 00:03:09.530
The Carly that I know wouldn't want 
happiness by turning the world into hell!

00:03:09.530 --> 00:03:10.660
That’s…

00:03:11.140 --> 00:03:12.870
That’s not true!

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:14.220
Carly!

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:18.080
I resurrected as a Dark 
Signer so that we could

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:22.080
turn life into hell and 
conquer the world together!

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:24.320
That's what I want!

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:26.750
That's our destiny!

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:27.600
You’re wrong!

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:30.520
When false destiny tricked me and led me

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:33.520
astray, you were the one who 
made me come to my senses!

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:39.050
The old Jack died in his 
battle against Yusei.

00:03:39.370 --> 00:03:42.420
The real Jack Atlas starts his life now.

00:03:42.420 --> 00:03:46.010
And try to become a real King.

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:50.200
I'll never forget what you said!

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:54.190
That’s why I'll choose how 
to live, just like you said!

00:03:54.450 --> 00:03:58.180
Other than negating the attack, 
Changing Destiny has another effect!

00:03:58.650 --> 00:04:03.100
Two choices: You can either regain 
life points equal to half the

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:07.600
negated monster's attack points, or 
I can take the same amount in damage!

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:09.860
You get to choose!

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:11.060
What?

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:15.670
Fortune Lady Earth has 2800 attack points.

00:04:15.670 --> 00:04:21.140
You can either regain 1400 life points 
or I can take 1400 points of damage.

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:23.110
Choose what you want!

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:26.960
Jack has 800 life points remaining.

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:31.580
If I choose the damage-dealing effect, 
Jack will run out of life points.

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:32.620
Why?

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:37.720
Though you dodged Earth’s attack last 
time, you’re fine with taking damage this time?

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:41.880
It’s to show you that there's 
no such thing as fixed destiny!

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:44.830
I believe in you!

00:04:45.060 --> 00:04:48.030
Choose your own destiny!

00:04:49.590 --> 00:04:51.030
Jack, you fool.

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:55.820
Even though you kept me in suspense, 
you're doing what I want in the end.

00:04:55.820 --> 00:04:59.010
Fine.  This time, I'll make you mine.

00:04:59.010 --> 00:05:01.830
I'll deal damage-

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:07.200
I…

00:05:08.470 --> 00:05:08.940
I…

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:12.060
I…

00:05:20.870 --> 00:05:23.970
I choose to restore my life points.

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:34.500
Carly…

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:38.320
Carly, you…

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:39.660
Jack.

00:05:39.660 --> 00:05:41.140
You’ve returned to normal.

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:42.310
I’m sorry.

00:05:42.310 --> 00:05:45.390
I actually don’t want to battle.

00:05:45.390 --> 00:05:49.530
I know.  You’re not the 
type who hurts other people.

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:52.720
I know that more than anyone else.

00:05:53.130 --> 00:05:54.200
Jack…

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:01.440
Carly, what’s wrong?

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:04.090
It doesn’t matter what you want.

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:08.750
Since you're a Dark Signer, 
you're ordered to battle!

00:06:12.400 --> 00:06:16.350
You're the one who pulled 
Carly into the darkness!

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:21.870
Carly, continue the duel 
and defeat the Signer!

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:24.730
Carly!

00:06:30.050 --> 00:06:31.470
How dare you!

00:06:31.470 --> 00:06:33.450
Let Carly go!

00:06:33.800 --> 00:06:36.410
My turn isn’t over yet!

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:38.860
Speed Spell - Curse of Destiny!

00:06:38.860 --> 00:06:44.590
When I have two or more Speed Counters, I 
place two Curse Counters on one of my monsters.

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:50.260
Instead of attacking, I can deal 
damage by removing a Curse Counter.

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:54.880
But since Earth already attacked this 
turn, I can't activate that effect.

00:06:54.880 --> 00:06:57.260
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:06:58.130 --> 00:07:02.560
The girl who loves you will devour your soul!

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:10.050
How dare you do this to Carly!

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:12.010
I won’t forgive you.

00:07:12.010 --> 00:07:14.650
I won’t forgive you, Dark Signer!

00:07:14.650 --> 00:07:16.220
My turn!

00:07:17.310 --> 00:07:23.320
When monsters are only on your field, I can 
Special Summon Vice Dragon from my hand!

00:07:23.320 --> 00:07:27.330
If it’s summoned due to this effect, 
its attack and defense points are halved!

00:07:27.330 --> 00:07:30.490
Next, I summon Dark Resonator from my hand!

00:07:33.460 --> 00:07:38.140
Level 3 Dark Resonator 
tunes Level 5 Vice Dragon!

00:07:38.670 --> 00:07:41.750
The pulse of the King now forms a line here!

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:44.440
Witness the power of the rumbling heavens!

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:45.880
Synchro Summon!

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:49.180
My soul!  Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:53.940
The monster that symbolizes the 
Signer has finally appeared!

00:07:53.940 --> 00:07:56.390
But I will turn the tables!

00:07:56.390 --> 00:07:58.020
I activate my trap!

00:07:58.020 --> 00:08:02.140
Class Change increases Fortune 
Lady Earth’s Level by one!

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:08.600
Since it gained a Level, Earth’s monster 
effect increases its attack points by 400!

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:12.560
Earth has more attack points 
than Red Dragon Archfiend.

00:08:12.560 --> 00:08:15.140
Earth’s other monster effect activates.

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:19.510
When a Fortune Lady's Level increases, 
you take 400 points of damage!

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:32.330
Your life points are like 
a candle in the wind!

00:08:32.330 --> 00:08:35.390
On my next turn, I'll completely devour you!

00:08:36.110 --> 00:08:38.060
I won’t let that happen!

00:08:38.060 --> 00:08:40.100
Speed Spell - Half Seeds!

00:08:40.610 --> 00:08:44.810
When I have three or more 
Speed Counters, your monster's

00:08:44.810 --> 00:08:48.810
attack points are halved, and I gain 
life points equal to that amount!

00:08:51.250 --> 00:08:54.550
Red Dragon Archfiend has 
higher attack points again!

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:56.030
How dare you!

00:08:56.030 --> 00:08:59.720
Evil soul, I'll burn you 
with the flame of truth!

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:03.300
Red Dragon Archfiend attacks 
Fortune Lady Earth!

00:09:03.300 --> 00:09:05.920
Absolute Powerforce!

00:09:08.760 --> 00:09:11.010
Carly, wake up!

00:09:16.170 --> 00:09:17.340
Carly!

00:09:17.340 --> 00:09:18.780
Carly!

00:09:25.960 --> 00:09:27.220
Yusei…

00:09:43.780 --> 00:09:46.010
What's that light?

00:09:47.680 --> 00:09:49.250
It's calling me.

00:09:59.760 --> 00:10:01.520
Where am I?

00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:03.910
Yusei…

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:07.920
It’s not your time yet 
to come to this world.

00:10:08.730 --> 00:10:11.470
Are you the one who guided me?

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:13.260
Father?

00:10:16.350 --> 00:10:18.430
Yusei, my son.

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:20.430
Like I thought…  Father…

00:10:20.660 --> 00:10:22.010
Forgive me.

00:10:22.400 --> 00:10:26.870
I've given you the burden 
of enormous destiny.

00:10:26.870 --> 00:10:28.040
Wait!

00:10:28.340 --> 00:10:31.460
But destiny can be changed.

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:33.090
Father!

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:38.250
There are people waiting for you 
on the path you’re taking.

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:39.730
Go, Yusei.

00:10:39.730 --> 00:10:42.190
Father!  Wait, Father!

00:10:42.190 --> 00:10:44.190
Father!

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:50.530
What’s this?

00:10:56.640 --> 00:10:58.240
Yusei!

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:04.280
Yusei, pull yourself together!

00:11:04.280 --> 00:11:05.100
Yusei…

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:05.950
Yusei!

00:11:08.880 --> 00:11:10.110
Thank goodness.

00:11:10.110 --> 00:11:12.780
I've returned?

00:11:13.850 --> 00:11:15.690
It looks like you're fine.

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:16.590
Yeah.

00:11:16.590 --> 00:11:18.670
But how did you…

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:20.650
Since he’s safe, who cares?

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:22.390
That’s why adults are no good!

00:11:23.260 --> 00:11:26.100
I'm sorry that I made you worry.

00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:30.380
Yusei, I'm sorry but we 
don’t have time to waste.

00:11:30.380 --> 00:11:32.390
That’s right!  There's no time!

00:11:32.390 --> 00:11:33.150
Yeah.

00:11:33.150 --> 00:11:39.090
If we don’t seal the remaining two towers by 
sunset, the king of the underworld will resurrect!

00:11:40.240 --> 00:11:42.210
Carly!

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:44.180
Are you okay?  Answer me!

00:11:44.180 --> 00:11:45.450
Carly!

00:11:57.480 --> 00:11:58.760
Carly!

00:11:58.760 --> 00:12:00.020
I activate my trap!

00:12:00.020 --> 00:12:01.730
Inherited Fortune!

00:12:01.730 --> 00:12:05.110
When a Fortune Lady is 
destroyed, I can Special

00:12:05.110 --> 00:12:08.910
Summon up to two Fortune Ladies 
from my hand on my next turn!

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:13.180
I set one card and end my turn.

00:12:14.190 --> 00:12:16.850
Is it too late to do anything?

00:12:16.850 --> 00:12:18.150
My turn!

00:12:20.230 --> 00:12:24.290
I can't turn you back to 
normal anymore, Carly?

00:12:25.960 --> 00:12:31.400
Due to Inherited Fortune's effect, 
I Special Summon two Fortune Ladies!

00:12:31.400 --> 00:12:35.730
Appear, Fortune Lady Wind 
and Fortune Lady Water!

00:12:36.870 --> 00:12:38.840
Water’s effect activates!

00:12:38.840 --> 00:12:43.770
For every Fortune Lady on 
my field, I draw one card!

00:12:43.770 --> 00:12:46.610
There are two Fortune Ladies on my field!

00:12:46.610 --> 00:12:48.510
Therefore, I draw two cards!

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:52.980
Jack, you'll be my sacrifice!

00:12:53.980 --> 00:12:56.220
I release Wind and Water!

00:12:59.190 --> 00:13:00.390
Is it coming?

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:04.390
After five thousand years, the 
door to the afterlife opens again!

00:13:04.580 --> 00:13:08.100
Our souls will feed the new world!

00:13:08.420 --> 00:13:10.560
Sacrificed to Earthbound Immortal...

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:13.550
Are they the souls of the people 
who vanished from Satellite?

00:13:13.900 --> 00:13:20.880
If the real Carly sees what's happening, 
she'll blame herself forever and cry in sadness.

00:13:21.790 --> 00:13:25.720
Descend, Earthbound Immortal Asila Piscu!

00:13:58.620 --> 00:14:02.840
Earthbound Immortal Asila 
Piscu can attack you directly!

00:14:02.840 --> 00:14:05.920
Jack, receive god’s judgment!

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:10.190
I'll stop you, even if it costs me my life!

00:14:10.190 --> 00:14:12.160
I Special Summon Battle Fader!

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:17.410
When your monster attacks me directly, 
I can Special Summon it from my hand.

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:20.590
Due to its effect, the Battle Phase ends!

00:14:29.560 --> 00:14:32.070
I set one card and end my turn!

00:14:32.780 --> 00:14:34.250
Carly, listen!

00:14:34.530 --> 00:14:38.240
In the past, I was a person who 
didn’t care about others!

00:14:38.240 --> 00:14:44.900
To further my ambitions, I betrayed my 
friends, hurt people and sacrificed everything!

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:49.100
But you taught me!

00:14:50.460 --> 00:14:55.070
If my heart truly believes, even 
my damaged heart can be saved!

00:14:57.730 --> 00:15:00.780
I wish with all my heart!

00:15:01.130 --> 00:15:04.780
I want to rescue you, the girl I love!

00:15:07.220 --> 00:15:08.360
What's this?

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:14.890
The mark is disappearing.

00:15:14.890 --> 00:15:16.700
The same thing happened before with Yusei!

00:15:16.700 --> 00:15:17.960
That means…

00:15:18.360 --> 00:15:20.860
The mark is going to Jack.

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:30.310
My friends' marks!

00:15:30.310 --> 00:15:32.720
Are they lending me their power?

00:15:34.110 --> 00:15:35.460
This light...

00:15:37.010 --> 00:15:38.990
My turn!

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:45.310
Is this the miracle of the Crimson Dragon?

00:15:45.570 --> 00:15:46.510
Jack…

00:15:47.220 --> 00:15:48.210
Jack…

00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:49.230
Jack…

00:15:50.600 --> 00:15:51.700
Jack…

00:15:54.750 --> 00:15:55.510
Jack…

00:15:56.450 --> 00:15:57.430
Carly?

00:15:57.430 --> 00:16:00.040
Jack, please end this.

00:16:00.040 --> 00:16:01.170
What?

00:16:01.930 --> 00:16:06.060
I don’t want to hurt you 
or other people anymore.

00:16:06.060 --> 00:16:10.020
No way!  There still has to be another way!

00:16:10.020 --> 00:16:12.920
If you truly care about me...

00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:16.250
But if I do that, you’ll be…

00:16:16.250 --> 00:16:18.990
I'm choosing this destiny.

00:16:19.190 --> 00:16:22.420
You truly understood me.

00:16:22.420 --> 00:16:26.010
So please defeat me with your own hands.

00:16:28.940 --> 00:16:30.400
I understand.

00:16:31.770 --> 00:16:36.020
If that’s what you want, I'll do it.

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:38.940
Thank you, Jack.

00:16:43.860 --> 00:16:44.650
Carly…

00:16:45.340 --> 00:16:46.560
My life…

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:50.840
You saved my life.

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:54.750
Appear, Majestic Dragon!

00:16:58.020 --> 00:17:05.350
Level 1 Majestic Dragon tunes Level 8 Red 
Dragon Archfiend and Level 1 Battle Fader!

00:17:05.350 --> 00:17:09.970
The superior polished light becomes 
the true ruler and shines on the land!

00:17:09.970 --> 00:17:11.740
Keep shining!

00:17:12.110 --> 00:17:14.040
Synchro Summon!

00:17:15.050 --> 00:17:18.790
The great soul Majestic Red Dragon!

00:17:20.250 --> 00:17:23.790
Majestic Red Dragon negates 
the effect of one monster on

00:17:23.790 --> 00:17:27.790
your field and gains its attack 
points until the End Phase!

00:17:27.790 --> 00:17:32.800
I negate Earthbound Immortal Asila Piscu’s 
effect and absorb its attack points!

00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:34.120
Power Gain!

00:17:40.670 --> 00:17:42.960
6500 attack points?

00:17:42.960 --> 00:17:46.530
As you wish, I'll defeat 
you with a single strike!

00:17:46.590 --> 00:17:48.090
But don’t worry.

00:17:48.090 --> 00:17:50.520
I won’t let you die alone.

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:53.350
My set card is Shockwave.

00:17:53.350 --> 00:17:56.100
With this card, one monster 
on the field is destroyed,

00:17:56.100 --> 00:17:59.100
and both players take damage 
equal to its attack points.

00:17:59.360 --> 00:18:05.750
If I use it to destroy Majestic Red Dragon, 
Carly and I will both take 6500 points of damage.

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:07.600
We'll both run out of life points.

00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:11.070
This is the destiny I've chosen for myself!

00:18:11.070 --> 00:18:13.590
I'll have no regrets if we die together!

00:18:16.040 --> 00:18:19.820
I'll tell the fortune of your true destiny.

00:18:23.780 --> 00:18:25.080
Here I go!

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:26.250
I activate my trap-

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:28.660
I activate my trap Earthbound Release!

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:31.400
What?

00:18:31.400 --> 00:18:36.500
By releasing an Earthbound Immortal, this 
card destroys all monsters on the field!

00:18:36.500 --> 00:18:41.220
Then you take damage equal to the total 
attack points of the destroyed monsters!

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:42.250
No way!

00:18:42.250 --> 00:18:46.120
Due to Majestic Red Dragon’s 
effect, your monster destruction

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:50.120
effect is negated, and you take 
damage equal to its attack points!

00:18:50.120 --> 00:18:52.170
Are you doing this intentionally?

00:19:06.970 --> 00:19:10.990
My real wish is that 
everyone loves you and that

00:19:10.990 --> 00:19:14.990
you become a true King that 
brings joy to everyone.

00:19:15.310 --> 00:19:18.420
I know you can do it, Jack Atlas!

00:19:24.540 --> 00:19:27.050
Carly!

00:19:42.940 --> 00:19:44.690
The geoglyph is disappearing.

00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:47.900
The duel must have ended.

00:19:50.940 --> 00:19:52.600
It looks like Jack won.

00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:55.250
Thank goodness!  Master Atlas!

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:59.280
Like I thought, you are the true King.

00:20:00.030 --> 00:20:01.280
Carly!

00:20:01.280 --> 00:20:02.740
Carly!

00:20:02.740 --> 00:20:05.670
Carly, hang on!  Don’t die!

00:20:05.670 --> 00:20:08.400
Jack, where are you?

00:20:08.400 --> 00:20:09.950
I’m right here!

00:20:10.170 --> 00:20:13.660
That’s weird.  I can’t see anything.

00:20:13.660 --> 00:20:16.370
Hang in there!  Look at me!

00:20:22.630 --> 00:20:27.190
I liked rooting for people who 
try hard.  Like you, Jack.

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:31.980
But I only did that because it made me happy.

00:20:32.300 --> 00:20:34.720
That’s why I was punished for my sins.

00:20:34.720 --> 00:20:36.310
What are you talking about?

00:20:36.310 --> 00:20:38.280
Everyone has the right to be happy!

00:20:38.490 --> 00:20:41.990
If that’s a sin, then I’m also a sinner!

00:20:43.030 --> 00:20:46.490
Jack, save the world.

00:20:47.060 --> 00:20:49.480
I’m rooting for you.

00:20:53.920 --> 00:20:55.930
I love you, Jack.

00:20:58.140 --> 00:20:59.240
Carly…

00:21:33.540 --> 00:21:35.200
Look, Yusei.

00:21:35.680 --> 00:21:37.890
Jack successfully sealed it!

00:21:37.890 --> 00:21:39.280
You did it, Jack!

00:21:39.790 --> 00:21:42.040
There’s only one seal remaining!

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:46.250
We'll stop the Dark Signers’ plans!

00:21:57.610 --> 00:22:02.080
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:02.440 --> 00:22:07.150
We will build our own future

00:22:07.620 --> 00:22:12.590
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:13.050 --> 00:22:17.760
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:23.360 --> 00:22:32.900
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:33.330 --> 00:22:38.470
This world can't be solved using algorithms

00:22:38.540 --> 00:22:43.180
Even if it loses its light

00:22:43.650 --> 00:22:48.450
The hourglass behind the 
heart can't be turned

00:22:48.450 --> 00:22:52.920
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:22:53.120 --> 00:22:58.500
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:22:58.630 --> 00:23:03.380
This journey has no end

00:23:03.600 --> 00:23:08.840
There's no meaning because there are no tears

00:23:09.270 --> 00:23:14.080
Hear my voice
